if that's an option.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:43.830
And so as they look
at these tracks,

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.840
they found that the
shipping traffic was moving

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.220
further and further north.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.870
And the volume of
the shipping traffic

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.078
was getting higher as these
waters are getting easier

00:03:51.078 --> 00:03:51.850
